      "resolution": "Split into two owners. Analytics owns semantic measures and derived analytical datasets. Reporting owns saved reports, execution, scheduling, exports and delivery. The `analytics-reporting` placeholder is replaced by `dotmac-analytics` and `dotmac-reporting` in cohort 8; neither is an unassigned adjudication any longer.",
