      "owner": "Michael Ayoade",
      "resolution": "Four owners, no product-owned link contract. Party owns organization capacities, memberships and reachability. Customers owns the account-to-Party binding. A new product-first `dotmac-addresses` owner owns normalized address, geospatial data and verification history. Customers, Services and Billing hold typed purpose links to address identities rather than copies of them.",
